Package: bsfrag
Title: Retrieval-Augmented Question Answering over the Black Soldier Fly Literature
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Thomas", "Klammsteiner", , "thomasklammsteiner@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds a searchable store from open-access articles on the black
    soldier fly (Hermetia illucens) and answers questions from it with a large
    language model that cites the passages it used. Includes corpus download
    from Europe PMC, conversion of JATS full texts to Markdown, heading-aware
    chunking, local embeddings, hybrid retrieval, a Shiny chat app and an
    expert-scored evaluation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tklammsteiner/bsfrag
